cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
title: "gsk_family: a verified hybrid C++/MATLAB toolkit for the Gaining-Sharing Knowledge optimizer family on CEC benchmark suites"
abstract: >-
  gsk_family packages six Gaining-Sharing Knowledge (GSK) metaheuristic
  variants (GSK, AGSK, APGSK, ATMALS-GSK, eGSK, FDB-AGSK) as MATLAB
  optimizers together with standalone, dependency-free C++20 ports of five
  CEC benchmark suites (CEC2011, CEC2013, CEC2013LSGO, CEC2017, CEC2020).
  An optional MEX bridge lets the MATLAB optimizers evaluate the exact
  compiled C++ benchmarks, and every experiment run is automatically
  verified against the matching optimizer's published reference table.
